    <p class="salutation">Dear Dr. Ramirez,</p>

    <p class="greeting">Greetings of peace and excellence!</p>

    <p>We are students of the Bachelor of Science in Computer Engineering (BSCpE) program under the College of Engineering at the University of Perpetual Help System DALTA – Calamba Campus. We are currently enrolled in our CPE Practice and Design and are conducting a research study entitled:</p>

    <blockquote class="study-title">
      “Design and Development of Student Academic Performance Evaluation System for College of Engineering at University of Perpetual Help System DALTA – Calamba Campus”
    </blockquote>

    <p>In line with this, we respectfully seek your permission to conduct our research within the College of Engineering of the University of Perpetual Help System DALTA – Calamba Campus. The research will involve interviews and surveys with selected engineering students, faculty members, academic advisers, and program chairs who are directly involved in academic evaluation and advising processes. We assure you that all research activities will be conducted in accordance with ethical standards and university policies.</p>

    <p>Please be assured that all information gathered from the participants will be treated with strict confidentiality and will be used solely for academic and research purposes. Furthermore, separate formal letters will be submitted to the concerned offices, departments, and individuals who will directly participate in the study.</p>

    <p>We sincerely hope for your favorable consideration and approval of this request. Your support will greatly contribute to the successful completion of our study.</p>

    <p class="thanks"><strong>Thank you very much.</strong></p>

    <p class="salutation">Respectfully yours,</p>

